I find the compass to be a striking idea.  I have been known to use the
wand of wishing and the "polymorph pile" plan just so that I could get
enough spellbooks of magic mapping to map each maze level and avoid the
tedium of finding my way through 20 or so mazes.  With a compass I could
just dig my way thru the mazes in a fairly straightforward way to the
stairs.

Yes, polymorphing piles is also tedious, but I'd rather do that than wind
thru so many mazes.  Besides, if you are clever about polymorphing piles
it's not so boring.


